# design-lint rules enabled for prop — adopted ONE AT A TIME.
#
# To adopt the next rule: add its id on its own line, run `scripts/lint-cases`,
# then burn down the new cases in lint/errors/ (see AGENTS.md > Design lint).
# Full catalog of rule ids: packages/design-lint (Linter::standard) or run
# `scripts/design-lint services packages supervisor` for the summary.
#
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.

